                            	  6393: _L_z04_CheckBigDigdoggerCollisions_LoopCornerCollision:
                            	  6394:     ; Digdogger is big, but room boundary checks and
                            	  6395:     ; object collision checks assume a 16x16 monster or smaller.
                            	  6396:     ; Therefore, we have to check these things four times,
                            	  6397:     ; in different corners of the boss.
                            	  6398:     ;
                            	  6399:     ; Loop 4 times, from 0 to 3.
                            	  6400:     ;
