                            	  7130: UpdateDodongoState_JumpTable:
02:0003C860 0003C86C        	  7131:     dc.l    UpdateDodongoState0_Move   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
02:0003C864 0003C8E2        	  7132:     dc.l    UpdateDodongoState1_Bloated   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
