02:0003C8F4 0003C904        	  7214:     dc.l    UpdateDodongoState1_Bloated_Sub_Wait   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
02:0003C8F8 0003C904        	  7215:     dc.l    UpdateDodongoState1_Bloated_Sub_Wait   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
