                            	  2132: DrawStatusBarItemsAndEnsureItemSelected:
                            	  2133:     ; Draws the selected item and the sword in the status bar.
                            	  2134:     ; Before drawing the item, it ensures that SelectedItemSlot
                            	  2135:     ; refers to an occupied, equippable item slot.
                            	  2136:     ;
                            	  2137:     ; This accounts for the fallback behavior between potions
                            	  2138:     ; and letters and the two boomerangs.
                            	  2139:     ;
                            	  2140:     ; Start at slot zero. Normally, it would be used to
                            	  2141:     ; check swords. When it's used as the selected item index;
                            	  2142:     ; it's a pseudo-slot used for checking boomerangs.
                            	  2143:     ;
